message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Image Classifier Application"
abstract: >
  A lightweight static web application for running ONNX image classifiers on
  IIIF manifests or local images directly in the browser. The application
  supports IIIF canvas classification, threshold adjustment, manual correction,
  heuristic filtering, and export of filtered IIIF Presentation API v3 manifests
  with machine-generated annotations.
